{"id":"n58246-1-7","stage":5,"title":"변기 · 马桶","scene":"居住与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n58246-1-7-1","ko":"볼일 보고 나서 변기 물 좀 내려!","zh":"上完厕所记得冲马桶！","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"볼일","meaning":"大小便","explanation":"볼일：大小便","readings":[{"term":"볼일","audio":"/audio/5033989f325c7b90016d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60065","senseId":"2","lemma":"볼일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"볼일","audio":"/audio/5033989f325c7b90016d.mp3"}},{"text":"보고","meaning":"办","explanation":"보다：办；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"9","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보고","audio":"/audio/ddf2aaf35f3c5a087464.mp3"}},{"text":"나서","meaning":"做完前面的动作（-고 나다）","explanation":"나다：做完前面的动作（-고 나다）；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"나다","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62134","senseId":"1","lemma":"나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나서","audio":"/audio/3e57ffe9f50d4fca37a8.mp3"}},{"text":"변기","meaning":"马桶，便器","explanation":"변기：马桶，便器","readings":[{"term":"변기","audio":"/audio/d1da6e4eeaca5f927b75.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58246","senseId":"1","lemma":"변기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"변기","audio":"/audio/d1da6e4eeaca5f927b75.mp3"}},{"text":"물","meaning":"水","explanation":"물：水","readings":[{"term":"물","audio":"/audio/2e7edc957ce601f5ff7c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17596","senseId":"1","lemma":"물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"물","audio":"/audio/2e7edc957ce601f5ff7c.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좀"